NEARS-1021 AC1 — directStore boot entry misroutes to Home (empty slug in resolver store route)

== Cold boot, single-store zone (zone 3, store 59), GUEST and LOGGED-IN — identical ==
[INFO] route: navigating to splash screen
analytics: sectors_shown {sectors_count: 1, zone_id: 3}
analytics: store_direct_opened {store_id: 59, module_id: 4, zone_id: 3}   <- resolver directStore branch ran
[INFO] route: initial route module=qa-single-store-grocery                 <- but nav lands on INITIAL (home)
[INFO] home load started
analytics: store_auto_opened {store_id: 59, module_id: 4, zone_id: 3}       <- home single-store hero impression
=> Screen from ~1s onward = DashboardScreen (Basket/Home/Profile bottom nav). StoreScreen NEVER mounts.

== Decisive A/B via store deep link (same GetPage the resolver navigates to) ==
A) WITH slug   /store/dama-baqala?id=3168&page=module  -> GET /stores/details/3168 200 -> StoreScreen renders. PASS
B) EMPTY slug  /store/?id=3168&page=module             -> "route: initial route module=1" -> lands on HOME. FAIL

Root cause: DestinationResolver.defaultStoreNavigation (destination_resolver.dart:130-138) builds
RouteHelper.getStoreRoute(id, page:'module', slug:'', autoOpened:true) -> URL "/store/?id=..&auto_opened=true".
The empty slug path segment does not match the GetPage name '/store/:slug' (route_helper.dart:718). With no
unknownRoute configured on GetMaterialApp (main.dart:248-275), GetX serves the first registered page = `initial`
(route_helper.dart:532, DashboardScreen). The Home single-store hero path works because it passes the real
store.slug (single_store_hero_view.dart:143). No error is logged — the misroute is SILENT and store_direct_opened
fires even though no visual direct-open occurred.
